    "Description": "PHP is an HTML-embedded scripting language commonly used with the Apache HTTP Server.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* php: PHP OpenSSL extension: Denial of Service due to buffer allocation flaw in AES-WRAP-PAD (CVE-2026-14355)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Backport fix for CVE-2026-14355 to PHP 7.4 in 8.10.z (JIRA:RHEL-192629)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
